* TEST 11: BE vs TR Sensitivity Comparison
* Use "Compare BE vs TR" mode in the GUI
* tau = R1*C1 = 1ms, dt = 200us (deliberately coarse)
*
* Expected differences:
*   V1 sensitivity: ~identical (DC source)
*   R1 sensitivity: ~5% difference between TR and BE
*   C1 sensitivity: ~11% difference between TR and BE
*
* In Waveform Plot: select V(2) and pick R1 or C1 as Sensitivity Target
* Solid line = TR (more accurate), Dashed = BE
V1 1 0 DC 0 PULSE(0 5 0 1n 1n 2.5m 5m)
R1 1 2 1k
C1 2 0 1u
.TRAN 200u 10m


